[{"title":"同周湛二上人游西湖之北山天竺晚归得十绝 其五","author":"释绍嵩","text":"湖上山林画不如，眼明喜见晓光舒。\n等闲稚子来横钓，一度抬竿一个鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15721,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同周湛二上人游西湖之北山天竺晚归得十绝 其三","author":"释绍嵩","text":"和靖先生坟已荒，三春花草殿馀芳。\n栏干倚遍斜阳晚，户牖轩窗总是香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15722,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同周湛二上人游西湖之北山天竺晚归得十绝 其十","author":"释绍嵩","text":"好是春风湖上亭，轩窗小憩俗尘清。\n湖山有意留侬款，杨柳飞花乱晚晴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15723,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同周湛二上人游西湖之北山天竺晚归得十绝 其二","author":"释绍嵩","text":"山如浓翠拥高鬟，石壁巉然不可攀。\n落日凤城佳气合，幻成一岛画图间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15724,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同周湛二上人游西湖之北山天竺晚归得十绝 其七","author":"释绍嵩","text":"北山迤逦自苍然，万象鲜明禁火前。\n愁里有诗人不会，栏边㶁㶁响流泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15725,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同周湛二上人游西湖之北山天竺晚归得十绝 其六","author":"释绍嵩","text":"闲来湖上立移时，独愧凭栏负碧漪。\n西寺木鱼东寺鼓，而今总入老夫诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15726,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同周湛二上人游西湖之北山天竺晚归得十绝 其四","author":"释绍嵩","text":"山云收雨半川晴，匠出西湖作画屏。\n剩欲题诗写怀抱，可怜踪迹似流萍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15727,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同周湛二上人游西湖之北山天竺晚归得十绝 其一","author":"释绍嵩","text":"行尽孤山碧四围，春光和暖恰相宜。\n微风披拂香来去，正是群芳烂熳时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15728,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"曲江野眺","author":"释绍嵩","text":"偶来清赏曲江头，人自无言水自流。\n欲作新诗图画取，乱峰寒木更孤舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15729,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵吴伯庸竹间梅花十绝 其四","author":"释绍嵩","text":"自读西湖处士诗，寻芳长恨见花迟。\n前程笑到山多处，竹里横斜一两枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15730,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵吴伯庸竹间梅花十绝 其八","author":"释绍嵩","text":"一度春来一度新，夕阳花坞净无尘。\n负暄孤坐松根石，细看横枝间绿筠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15731,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵吴伯庸竹间梅花十绝 其五","author":"释绍嵩","text":"携茶时复过幽亭，寄目悠然上杳冥。\n好是园林争秀发，梅花白白竹青青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15732,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵吴伯庸竹间梅花十绝 其十","author":"释绍嵩","text":"竹与梅花相并枝，月明还见影参差。\n撚梅细比新诗看，酷似梅花太瘦时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15733,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵吴伯庸竹间梅花十绝 其六","author":"释绍嵩","text":"雪引春归竹外梅，慇勤今日一时开。\n知音未出吴公子，长到花时把酒杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15734,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵吴伯庸竹间梅花十绝 其一","author":"释绍嵩","text":"竹间初拆半斜枝，正是周王二月时。\n竹映梅花花映竹，主人不剪要题诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15735,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵吴伯庸竹间梅花十绝 其二","author":"释绍嵩","text":"孤芳高节共亭亭，子细相看似有情。\n春色恼人眠不得，移床换枕到天明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15736,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵吴伯庸竹间梅花十绝 其九","author":"释绍嵩","text":"日移花影上帘钩，品格堪怜绝比俦。\n竹外一枝斜更好，眼明端为小迟留。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15737,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵吴伯庸竹间梅花十绝 其七","author":"释绍嵩","text":"池边梅映竹边池，皎月勾添光陆离。\n堪笑胡雏亦风味，从教横笛月中吹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15738,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵吴伯庸竹间梅花十绝 其三","author":"释绍嵩","text":"一川脩竹映疏花，穿竹微吟路径斜。\n更好碧溪深院静，月和疏影上檐牙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15739,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江上","author":"释绍嵩","text":"春岸波平汀草深，江云黯黯作愁阴。\n诗材眼界知多少，欲罢不能聊一吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15740,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江上嬉行和永上人","author":"释绍嵩","text":"飞花满眼句纵横，江上闲吟立又行。\n正是如今江上好，薰风尽日语流莺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15741,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"至昌国","author":"释绍嵩","text":"浪迹悠然到海乡，人烟物景共苍苍。\n孤猿更发秋风里，赖有从前石作肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15742,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟中书事","author":"释绍嵩","text":"南昌城郭枕江烟，一苇鸣桹下渺然。\n惊起暮天沙上雁，背人飞过北山前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15743,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟中戏书","author":"释绍嵩","text":"乔木荒城古渡头，鸟啼花落水空流。\n从吾所好烟波上，祇在船中老便休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15744,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟中戏书 其一","author":"释绍嵩","text":"芳草青青古渡头，扁舟几日为诗留。\n心闲对境浑无竞，寂寂长江万里流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15745,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟中戏书 其二","author":"释绍嵩","text":"十二峰前且系船，眼中百里旧山川。\n遥知此夕多情思，江月随人处处圆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15746,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟泊严滩","author":"释绍嵩","text":"万里春流绕钓矶，扁舟系柳向朱扉。\n悠然到此忘情处，默默无言对落晖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15747,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西湖晚泛","author":"释绍嵩","text":"苏堤一带柳阴长，柳外西风特地狂。\n晚泊孤舟古祠下，自弹别鹤送斜阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15748,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈胡伯圆尚书 其一","author":"释绍嵩","text":"自挽狂澜制百川，致君何日不尧年。\n由来八座尚书贵，盛事骎骎海内传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15749,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈胡伯圆尚书 其二","author":"释绍嵩","text":"文章近日合双行，四海苍生耳已倾。\n地去秉钧馀咫尺，不劳拟议话圆成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15750,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈胡伯圆尚书 其三","author":"释绍嵩","text":"韩李流芳独未泯，先生孤唱发阳春。\n惠能伎俩元无有，强到朱门谒近臣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15751,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"坐夏净慈戏书解嘲","author":"释绍嵩","text":"南屏寄傲且今年，况复相羊得自便。\n天下无人闲似我，闲中方寸阔于天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15752,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泛湖","author":"释绍嵩","text":"六月西湖锦绣乡，新诗满眼费平章。\n移舟水溅差差绿，吹面轻风与送香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15753,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其三十六","author":"释绍嵩","text":"岸木萧疏野望宽，小楼西角剩凭栏。\n江边一树垂垂发，留与纷纷雪里看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15754,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其六","author":"释绍嵩","text":"竹外孤村坐见梅，直疑冰玉作根荄。\n青鞋自笑无羁束，不记登临日几回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15755,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其十","author":"释绍嵩","text":"古寺高楼暮倚栏，小梅零落雪欺残。\n一枝带雨墙头出，乞与时人画里看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15756,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其三十二","author":"释绍嵩","text":"湖边春色十分深，恨满枝枝被雨淋。\n羌笛一声何处曲，等闲惊起故园心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15757,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其二十二","author":"释绍嵩","text":"梅萼才开已乱飞，清香时被好风吹。\n苦无疏影横斜句，空作主人惆怅诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15758,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其十四","author":"释绍嵩","text":"积翠千层一径开，篮舆歇处见株梅。\n为君绕树须千匝，谩使诗肠日九回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15759,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其三十八","author":"释绍嵩","text":"梅出稽山世少双，月中疏影暗中香。\n梦回彷佛三更后，卧见琼枝低压墙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15760,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其四十五","author":"释绍嵩","text":"岸树低攲一雪馀，此花风韵更清姝。\n江亭独倚栏干处，日影描窗作画图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15761,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其十二","author":"释绍嵩","text":"再见山城石井边，幽姿高韵独翛然。\n要知不被梅花笑，更把前题改数联。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15762,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其五","author":"释绍嵩","text":"月榭风亭绕曲池，野梅千树压疏篱。\n暗香别有关情处，独倚栏干默自知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15763,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其二十八","author":"释绍嵩","text":"粲粲江南万玉妃，随宜领览到斜晖。\n一枝缟色分明好，自是行人折赠稀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15764,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其四十二","author":"释绍嵩","text":"定回犹觉幻身轻，更著梅花巧尽情。\n月上栏干照孤影，一枝斜映小窗明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15765,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其二十九","author":"释绍嵩","text":"乱点琼葩艳艳明，半粘残雪不胜清。\n春风十里梅花路，拄杖寻诗独自行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15766,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其四十三","author":"释绍嵩","text":"瘦倚疏篁半出墙，天教春信到寒乡。\n老人终岁闭门坐，月下风前自在香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15767,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其八","author":"释绍嵩","text":"水际空明月正圆，看花候月思依然。\n暗香疏影浑无赖，绰约冰姿绝可怜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15768,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其十九","author":"释绍嵩","text":"镂冰叠雪斗轻盈，碧瓦朱栏相照明。\n想得彭园富春色，数枝春色岂无情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15769,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其二十","author":"释绍嵩","text":"夜起荆扉趁暗香，林间梅下卜斋房。\n寒窗安著清相向，清杀东坡锦绣肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15770,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其三十五","author":"释绍嵩","text":"洛阳三十六峰西，曾为梅花醉似泥。\n今日偶题题似著，屋檐斜入一枝低。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15771,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其四十七","author":"释绍嵩","text":"倚赖春风压众芳，枝枝灼灼烂生光。\n向来子美知如此，可是无心赋海棠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15772,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其三十一","author":"释绍嵩","text":"隔水深深几树芳，巧如施粉妒何郎。\n好风领略知人意，时去时来管送香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15773,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"林敏修","text":"岁寒群物惨无光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15774,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其十五","author":"释绍嵩","text":"露裛幽花冷自香，此花尽更有商量。\n肌肤冰雪薰沉水，疏影寒光照野塘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15775,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其三十","author":"释绍嵩","text":"叶气先传五岭梅，新冰削玉辟风开。\n花前独立无人会，一片异香天上来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15776,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其二十七","author":"释绍嵩","text":"梅花两树照春阴，花径吹香可细寻。\n疏影横斜水清浅，平生和靖最知音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15777,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其三","author":"释绍嵩","text":"手种疏梅已发妍，今年春色胜常年。\n一枝清峭临荒岸，输与渔人系钓船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15778,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其二十四","author":"释绍嵩","text":"一树寒梅白玉条，傍岩隈石韵萧萧。\n诗孱无柰陈桥月，月照清香太易消。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15779,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其四十一","author":"释绍嵩","text":"风静寒塘花正开，直须冰雪作梯媒。\n时平不怕山荒寂，霜晓无人我独来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15780,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其四","author":"释绍嵩","text":"绕树寻花得得来，摩挲苍石更徘徊。\n题诗未有惊人句，谩想华光写照才。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15781,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其三十三","author":"释绍嵩","text":"竹里梅花映白头，梅花欲动忆吾州。\n只今且为梅花醉，试问梅花可忍不。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15782,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其十六","author":"释绍嵩","text":"玉树交横雪后天，新诗吟得百馀篇。\n邮筒不住如飞翼，送与襄阳孟浩然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15783,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其七","author":"释绍嵩","text":"曳履来登千仞峰，路分溪石夹烟丛。\n晚香消歇无寻处，尽在疏枝冷蕊中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15784,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其五十","author":"释绍嵩","text":"独吟高阁对官梅，春色先从笔底回。\n诗到扬州定清绝，不才羞作等闲来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15785,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其四十","author":"释绍嵩","text":"一径萧萧松影低，寻花觅路忽成迷。\n诗材虽乏三千首，闻见随时入品题。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15786,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其九","author":"释绍嵩","text":"洞水悲鸣无歇时，人稀景静雪消迟。\n东风信有芳菲意，昨日梅花开一枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15787,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其十八","author":"释绍嵩","text":"篱落寒梅三两枝，水沉为骨玉为肌。\n悬知此去长闲暇，看尽东风烂熳时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15788,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其十七","author":"释绍嵩","text":"露冷霜乾玉骨寒，异香盈鼻酷如兰。\n清癯偶入骚人眼，往往开窗尽日看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15789,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其四十八","author":"释绍嵩","text":"春风并力著寒梅，一半先开笑未开。\n我亦悠然动清兴，欲题凡韵辄徘徊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15790,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其四十四","author":"释绍嵩","text":"不随桃李待春回，不待商量细细开。\n要识此花奇绝处，月明溪影乱毰毸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15791,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其三十四","author":"释绍嵩","text":"傲雪凌风太瘦生，静中无色自娉婷。\n何妨回施老摩诘，画我江行作小屏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15792,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其十一","author":"释绍嵩","text":"即看青女夜飞霜，借与南枝作淡妆。\n露重冰清风日暖，人间一味有真香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15793,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其二","author":"释绍嵩","text":"白玉花头碧玉枝，茅檐竹坞两幽奇。\n从今日日须来看，看尽将开欲落时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15794,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其一","author":"释绍嵩","text":"暖律还吹岭上梅，数枝先发日徘徊。\n苔封曲径无人到，付与春风自在开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15795,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏梅五十首呈史尚书 其二十六","author":"释绍嵩","text":"衰草连天惨淡黄，梅兼白雪一时芳。\n谁知老子懒成癖，花落花开已两忘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":15796,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]